SVGA-Next

The svga-player rendering sources and the sample assets are derived from
SVGAPlayer-Android, https://github.com/svga/SVGAPlayer-Android
at commit 662d0dc11824e35a3f3fcd247f491efce2bf5ec5, licensed under Apache-2.0.
Original copyright and contributor notices are preserved in those sources.

Modifications: independent namespace, current Android build, safer parsing,
resource ownership and per-drawable playback state. See docs/UPSTREAM.md.

The svga-core and svga-runtime modules are independently authored here.
They implement explicit resource ownership, cache accounting, request
coalescing and Android view lifecycle management.

The benchmark-upstream module contains the same pinned official snapshot,
relocated and adapted for the current SDK/compiler, for sample comparisons
only. See docs/PERFORMANCE.md.
